# Binder diagnostic cases (testing.md §3, BinderDiagnosticTests).
# A case starts with "=== CODE line,col" (1-based position of the expected diagnostic); the snippet is every
# following line up to the next "===" line or the end of the file. The snippet must parse without syntax errors and
# give exactly this one diagnostic, counting preprocessor/parser warnings and hints, binder and flow-analysis results.
# Codes without a case are listed with their reason in diagnostics.uncovered (EveryDiagnosticIsCovered). Lines starting with "#" before the first case are comments.

